生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:omniknight_hammer_of_purity:lifesteal:base", "mechanism": "lifesteal", "mechanism_zh": "吸血", "definition": "攻击或技能恢复自身生命：按造成的伤害、按目标生命或每次攻击固定值（攻击吸血、技能吸血、如噬魂鬼·盛宴、附魂面具）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f5a8f83fc59e587a654d", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f2136996ac190ba19044", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "oracle_false_promise", "name_zh": "神谕者·虚妄之诺", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Temporarily alters an ally's destiny, delaying any healing or damage taken until False Promise ends. Any healing that is delayed by False Promise is amplified. Removes most negative status effects and disables on initial cast. DISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Delayed damage and healing will take armor and magic resistance reductions into account when received.", "The delayed damage and healing takes effect as soon as the target becomes vulnerable."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Temporarily alters an ally's destiny, delaying any healing or damage taken until False Promise ends. Any healing that is delayed by False Promise is amplified. Removes most negative status effects and disables on initial cast. DISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Delayed damage and healing will take armor and magic resistance reductions into account when received.", "The delayed damage and healing takes effect as soon as the target becomes vulnerable."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "mana_costs", "old": [100, 150, 200], "new": [125, 175, 225]}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [100, 150, 200], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [125, 175, 225], "scepter": null, "shard":