ian Desolator."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Corrosion Your attacks reduce the target's armor by %corruption_armor%, slows their movement by %slow_ranged%%% (%slow_melee%%% against melee targets), and reduces Health Restoration by %heal_reduction%%%. Lasts for %duration% seconds.", "notes_loc": ["Armor reduction does not stack with its components, Desolator, or Stygian Desolator.", "Slow and Health Restoration Reduction does not stack with its components or Eye of Skadi."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "flags", "old": 0, "new": 16}, {"field": "item_cost", "old": 1050, "new": 880}], "rows": [{"review_id": "2ec2ed2a104021d2967b", "mechanism": "armor_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减护甲", "definition": "降低目标护甲", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:orb_of_corrosion:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "3bf4f912189e3573f751", "mechanism": "heal_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "治疗削减", "definition": "降低或禁止目标的任何形式生命恢复，含属性回复；提升生命上限的效果不受影响", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "bae6d7685c525c50779a", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "orb_of_frost", "name_zh": "冰霜之珠", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Frost Your attacks slow the target's movement by %slow_ranged%%% (%slow_melee%%% against melee targets), and reduces Health Restoration by %heal_reduction%%%. Lasts for %duration% seconds."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Frost Your attacks slow the target's movement by %slow_ranged%%% (%slow_melee%%% against melee targets), and reduces Health Restoration by %heal_reduction%%%. Lasts for %duration% seconds."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "flags", "old": 0, "new": 16}], "rows": [{"review_id": "a